A couple of code-review comments: (You really need to read http://docs.moodle.org/en/Development:Coding_style if you want to submit patches)

1. You should use 4-spaces, not a tab for indent.
2. Opening curley braces should be on the same line as the control statement (In JavaScript as well as in PHP.)
3. JavaScript should be in a separate .js file, not inline in the HTML. 
4. The 'or true' bit probably should not be there.

